hem run in the background, a concept we explored in previous lessons.</p>
<p>Understanding how to effectively utilize this command is crucial for man=
aging the scalability of your applications, ensuring that they can handle i=
ncreased workloads seamlessly.</p></div></div><div class=3D"space-y-32"><di=
v class=3D"text-theme-strong text-h-md">Modifying Compose File for Scaling<=
